                ],
                [
                    295.0,
                    1682.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "2. 資料與隨機變數的機率表示",
            "block_bbox": [
                295,
                1809,
                1061,
                1875
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    295.0,
                    1809.0
                ],
                [
                    1061.0,
                    1809.0
                ],
                [
                    1061.0,
                    1875.0
                ],
                [
                    295.0,
                    1875.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "在建構機器學習模型時，其核心邏輯通常可表述為：「在特定觀察條件下，某結果發生的可能性有多大。」這意味著我們並非尋求唯一解，而是學習一種條件機率分佈（Conditional Probability Distribution）。",
            "block_bbox": [
                295,
                1917,
                2079,
                2179
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    295.0,
                    1917.0
                ],
                [
                    2079.0,
                    1917.0
                ],
                [
                    2079.0,
                    2179.0
                ],
                [
                    295.0,
                    2179.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "其形式可表示為： $  \\mathbf{P} \\left( \\mathbf{Y} \\mid \\mathbf{X} \\right)  $，其中 X 為輸入特徵（Feature）、Y 為目標變數（Label）。這樣的機率模型有兩種意涵：",
            "block_bbox": [
                313,
                2217,
                2081,
                2378
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    313.0,
                    2217.0
                ],
                [
                    2081.0,
                    2217.0
                ],
                [
                    2081.0,
                    2378.0
                ],
                [
                    313.0,
                    2378.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "預測導向：模型輸出為某結果的機率（如分類機率），而非確定性分類結果。",
            "block_bbox": [
                399,
                2417,
                2076,
                2478
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    399.0,
                    2417.0
                ],
                [
                    2076.0,
